    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Provenance and offline evidence",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Indoor:** Arduino/BME280 over USB. **Outdoor:** [Open-Meteo](https://open-meteo.com/) weather model estimates, [CC BY 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), not a sensor outside the house. Weather points use model valid time; repeated fetches never refresh that time. Red age means stale. **No data means unavailable, never zero.** Simulation is a separate source. Data retention: 90 days. Same-organisation users share access to this dataset."
      }
